g when it exists, else the name as given), so the tree view's arrows, the menu check mark, the window logo, the search button and Markdig's link icon draw with LCD edges once the app ships an SVG, and apps that only ship the PNGs are unchanged (new SvgFirstIconTests). WhiteToAlpha keeps an icon's LCD coverage - it only clears pixels, never adds alpha - so WhiteToAlpha_GreyToColor icons keep their subpixel edges. MaxRGB32 in InvertLightness and Threshold read the blue byte three times, so Threshold turned a pixel bright only in red or green black; it now reads all three, and DoThreshold on an 8-bit image tests its own byte (Threshold.Gray8) instead of reading the next two pixels (new RgbThresholdTests)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"jondgoodwin/cone","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-02T18:43:16Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"b07a3adc45bde1c111cbd6182c9cc65420fe56c2","github_link":"https://github.com/jondgoodwin/cone/commit/b07a3adc45bde1c111cbd6182c9cc65420fe56c2","commit_subject":"Remove tools/refmeasure from the repo","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"inetsoft-technology/stylebi","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-02T18:42:58Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"ccf94c5c0e2e35943ea53399967bc9f1d2bb1d2d","github_link":"https://github.com/inetsoft-technology/stylebi/commit/ccf94c5c0e2e35943ea53399967bc9f1d2bb1d2d","commit_subject":"Bug #77588, encode control characters in repository entry XML so it reads back (#6141)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"inetsoft-technology/stylebi","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-02T18:42:54Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"3e12efc3e8e3c73bd2ee6ce36e0e6b1e1781a5ed","github_link":"https://github.com/inetsoft-technology/stylebi/commit/3e12efc3e8e3c73bd2ee6ce36e0e6b1e1781a5ed","commit_subject":"Bug #77583, fall back to default for non-integer dynamic int/double values (#6140)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"inetsoft-technology/stylebi","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-02T18:42:49Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"074d6271217037ef19705d7362cf40b14feda69c","g